@startuml
title StrawberryBot - Training and Data Preparation Sequence
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Developer
participant "Labels.csv" as LABELS
participant "convert_csv.py" as CSV
participant "convert_aug.py" as AUG
participant "dataset/" as DATASET
participant "dataset_aug/" as AUGSET
participant "AiTrain.py" as TRAIN
participant "Ultralytics YOLO" as YOLO
participant "PyTorch" as TORCH

Developer -> CSV: run script
CSV -> LABELS: read annotations (pandas)
CSV -> DATASET: write YOLO .txt label files\n(x_center, y_center, w, h normalised)
note right of CSV
  One .txt per image.
  Class 0 = Strawberry only.
end note
CSV --> Developer: "Conversion complete"

Developer -> AUG: run script
AUG -> AUGSET: clear and recreate train/val folders
AUG -> DATASET: read images and labels

loop per source image
  AUG -> AUGSET: save original to val split
  AUG -> AUGSET: flip horizontal  (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: flip vertical    (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: brightness shift (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: HSV colour shift (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: 50pct zoom-in crop, labels recomputed (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: 35pct zoom-out pad (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: darken x0.55 (train)
  AUG -> AUGSET: heavy Gaussian blur 51x51 (train)
  note right of AUG
    bg_swap is disabled by default.
    When enabled: foreground extracted
    via white-pixel threshold and
    composited onto random backgrounds.
  end note
end

AUG -> AUG: generate 30 train + 5 val synthetic negatives\n(random blobs on varied backgrounds)
AUG -> AUG: generate 8 solid-red + 5 mixed-red negatives\n(teaches model: red alone != strawberry)
AUG -> AUGSET: write all negatives with empty label files
AUG --> Developer: "Done - N originals to M train / K val"

Developer -> TRAIN: run script
TRAIN -> TORCH: check cuda availability
TORCH --> TRAIN: True / False
TRAIN -> YOLO: load yolov8n.pt base weights
TRAIN -> YOLO: model.train(\n  data=data.yaml, epochs=75,\n  imgsz=960, batch=16,\n  cache=ram, workers=8,\n  patience=5\n)
note right of YOLO
  data.yaml points to dataset_aug/.
  nc=1, names: Strawberry / rotten / leaf.
  Early stop after 5 epochs without gain.
  Dataset cached in RAM after epoch 1.
end note

loop per epoch until convergence
  YOLO -> AUGSET: load batch from RAM cache
  YOLO -> TORCH: forward + backward pass
  TORCH --> YOLO: gradients
end

YOLO -> AUGSET: final validation on val split
YOLO --> TRAIN: mAP50 and mAP50-95
TRAIN --> Developer: best.pt saved to runs/detect/*/weights/

note right of TRAIN
  Deploy best.pt to Pi at:
  runs/detect/CV/weights/best.pt
  (MODEL_PATH in config.py)
end note

@enduml
